{"script":"yd_041_01","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"addImg":"","noIn":false,"x":-500,"img":"bgblack","scaleY":1.5,"bright":1,"layer":"bg","y":-125,"mirrow":false},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":0.4,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"addImg":"","noIn":false,"x":-500,"img":"bgblack","scaleY":1.5,"bright":1,"layer":"bg","y":-125,"mirrow":false},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1a","noIn":false,"x":276,"img":"chara041_1","scaleY":1,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","y":-325,"mirrow":false},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1a","noIn":false,"x":276,"img":"chara041_1","scaleY":1,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","y":-325,"mirrow":false},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"text":"[show]早上好。你是准备出门吗？[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1d","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"text":"[show]我吗？我刚刚操练回来。这是我们治安队每天都要做的训练。[r]只有保持训练，才能提振精神，纪律也不会松散。[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"text":"[show]而且，治安队的工作是非常繁重的，根本没有多少空余时间。[r]所以我们只能挤出早晨的时间来操练了。[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1d","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"text":"[show]你说，现在我也不在治安队里，可以放松一些？的确，现在的我只是一介契约者，不需要训练属下，可以抽出更多时间……[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1e","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"text":"[show]但我觉得，锻炼精神不分职业，凡事都有需要遵守的纪律。[r]这样吧，从明天开始，我也来训练训练你吧！不用担心，一定可以让你也懂得这个道理的！[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"}],"des":"埃迪蒂-友善1"}